      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "送客往洞庭",
    "poem": [
      "九江歸路遠，萬里客舟還。",
      "若過巴江水，湘東滿碧煙。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_011_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "別友人",
    "poem": [
      "倦客驚危路，傷禽遶樹枝。",
      "非逢暴公子，不敢涕流離。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_012_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "初渡淮北岸",
    "poem": [
      "別夢雖難覺，悲魂最易銷。",
      "慇勤淮北岸，鄉近去家遙。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_013_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
