      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "春霽晚望",
    "poem": [
      "細雨晴深小苑東，春雲開氣逐光風。",
      "雄兒走馬神光上，靜女看花佛寺中。",
      "書劍學多心欲懶，田園荒廢望頻空。",
      "南歸路極天連海，惟有相思明月同。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_019_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "唐昌觀玉蘂花",
    "poem": [
      "瑤華瓊蘂種何年，蕭史秦嬴向紫煙。",
      "時控綵鸞過舊邸，摘花持獻玉皇前。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_020_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "別李協",
    "poem": [
      "江邊日暮不勝愁，送客霑衣江上樓。",
      "明月峽添明月照，蛾眉峰似兩眉愁。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_021_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "初次巴陵",
    "poem": [
      "西江浪接洞庭波，積水遙臉天上河。",
      "鄉信為憑誰寄去，汀洲燕雁漸來多。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_022_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "上巳",
    "poem": [
      "帝京元巳足繁華，細管清弦七貴家。",
      "此日風光誰不共，紛紛皆是掖垣花。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_023_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "春怨",
    "poem": [
      "花滿簾櫳欲度春，此時夫壻在咸秦。",
      "綠窗孤寢難成寐，紫燕雙飛似弄人。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_024_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
