      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "送客歸常州",
    "poem": [
      "行到河邊從此辭，寒天日遠暮帆遲。",
      "可憐芳草成衰草，公子歸時過綠時。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_025_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "送別",
    "poem": [
      "春愁不盡別愁來，舊淚猶長新淚催。",
      "相思倘寄相思字，君到揚州揚子迴。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_026_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
