      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "送客入蜀",
    "poem": [
      "劍閣迢迢夢想間，行人歸路遶梁山。",
      "明朝騎馬搖鞭去，秋雨槐花子午關。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_027_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
