      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "送別",
    "poem": [
      "仙花笑盡石門中，石室重重掩綠空。",
      "暫下雲峰能幾日，卻回煙駕馭春風。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_028_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "殘花",
    "poem": [
      "五馬踟躕在路岐，南來只為看花枝。",
      "鶯銜蝶弄紅芳盡，此日深閨那得知。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_029_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "戲贈友人",
    "poem": [
      "湘陰直與地陰連，此日相逢憶醉年。",
      "美酒非如平樂貴，十升不用一千錢。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_290_030_01",
    "volume": 290,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "楊凝",
      "recorded": "楊凝",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yang Ning",
      "wikidata_id": "Q11100355"
    },
    "title": "贈同遊",
    "poem": [
      "此□風雨後，已覺減年華。",
      "若待皆無事，應難更有花。",
      "管弦臨夜急，榆柳向江斜。",
      "且莫看歸路，同須醉酒家。"
    ],
